Package: ReGIFT
Type: Package
Title: Replicate-Guided Matrix Factorization for Single-Cell Transcriptomics
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("ReGIFT", "Development Team", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "haohaostats@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Fits interpretable replicate-guided matrix factorization models
    to single-cell count data. ReGIFT separates condition responses that are
    shared across biological replicates from donor-specific deviations and
    technical variation, and provides state-resolved response summaries,
    held-out donor projection, and donor-level inference.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.3.0)
Imports: Matrix, Rcpp, stats
LinkingTo: Rcpp, RcppArmadillo
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
LazyData: true
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
URL: https://github.com/haohaostats/ReGIFT
BugReports: https://github.com/haohaostats/ReGIFT/issues
